          <p class="section-label">About Us</p>
          <h2 id="about-heading">Good food brings people <em>closer together</em></h2>
          <p class="about-lead">
            Saffron Table began as a cosy neighbourhood kitchen built on a simple
            promise: cook everything fresh from scratch and serve every guest like family.
          </p>
          <p class="about-text">
            Every morning, our chefs hand-select local vegetables, aromatic whole spices,
            farmhouse cheeses, and stone-milled flour. Whether you stop by for a quick
            toasted sandwich, share a crisp pizza with friends, or gather for a hearty
            Sunday biryani, we focus on balanced flavours, generous portions, and warm,
            attentive service from the moment you walk in.
          </p>

          <!-- Three core dining standards -->
          <div class="about-highlights">
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <h3>Fresh Ingredients</h3>
              <p>Sourced daily from trusted local markets and farms.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <h3>Crafted Kitchen</h3>
              <p>Prepared to order with authentic, balanced recipes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <h3>Warm Service</h3>
              <p>Welcoming staff and a calm, comfortable dining space.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#menu">View Signature Dishes</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
