                <span>Serves 1&ndash;2</span>
                <span>Veg / Chicken</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Menu Card 4: Pasta -->
          <article class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-card-image">
              <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/12653291/pexels-photo-12653291.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=627&w=1200"
                   alt="Classic pasta tossed in tangy red tomato sauce with grated parmesan and fresh basil"
                   width="1200" height="627" loading="lazy">
              <span class="menu-tag">Chef&rsquo;s Pick</span>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-card-body">
              <div class="menu-card-top">
                <h3>Pasta</h3>
                <span class="menu-price">&#8377;299</span>
              </div>
              <p class="menu-card-desc">
                Al dente pasta tossed in slow-simmered roasted garlic tomato sauce with
                chilli flakes, fresh garden basil, aged parmesan, and warm garlic bread.
              </p>
              <div class="menu-card-meta">
                <span>Choice of Sauce</span>
                <span>Vegetarian</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Menu Card 5: Sandwich -->
          <article class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-card-image">
              <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8478417/pexels-photo-8478417.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=627&w=1200"
                   alt="Golden grilled club sandwich stacked with garden-fresh greens and held with skewers"
                   width="1200" height="627" loading="lazy">
              <span class="menu-tag">Cafe Classic</span>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-card-body">
              <div class="menu-card-top">
                <h3>Sandwich</h3>
                <span class="menu-price">&#8377;199</span>
              </div>
              <p class="menu-card-desc">
                Triple-layer grilled club sandwich built on crisp multigrain bread with
                herbed cottage cheese, ripe tomatoes, crunchy greens, and mint pesto dressing.
              </p>
              <div class="menu-card-meta">
                <span>Served with Dip</span>
                <span>Light Bite</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Menu Card 6: Desserts -->
          <article class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-card-image">
              <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/26838689/pexels-photo-26838689.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=627&w=1200"
                   alt="Velvety slice of homemade tiramisu dusted with cocoa and fresh mint leaf garnish"
                   width="1200" height="627" loading="lazy">
              <span class="menu-tag">Sweet Craft</span>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-card-body">
              <div class="menu-card-top">
                <h3>Desserts</h3>
                <span class="menu-price">&#8377;219</span>
              </div>
              <p class="menu-card-desc">
                Silky classic tiramisu layered with espresso-soaked sponge, whipped
                mascarpone cream, dark cocoa dusting, and a fresh sprig of garden mint.
              </p>
              <div class="menu-card-meta">
                <span>Freshly Chilled</span>
                <span>Eggless Option</span>
              </div>
            </div>
