          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Featured Promotional Banner -->
        <article class="offer-banner">
          <div class="offer-banner-content">
            <span class="offer-pill">Featured Offer &middot; Fri to Sun</span>
            <h3>Weekend Family Feast &mdash; Flat 20% Off</h3>
            <p>
              Gather around with any two wood-fired pizzas, one family-size dum biryani,
              fresh side salads, and four house desserts at an exclusive weekend table discount.
            </p>
            <p class="offer-validity">Valid on dine-in orders above &#8377;1,299 &middot; Show offer at your table</p>
