              Pick one pasta or burger, pair it with a toasted garlic side and a chilled
              seasonal citrus mocktail between 12:00 PM and 3:30 PM.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="offer-card offer-card-accent">
            <span class="offer-badge">Wednesdays</span>
            <h3>Stone-Oven Pizza Treat</h3>
            <p class="offer-price-tag">50% Off 2nd Pizza</p>
            <p class="offer-desc">
              Order any signature hand-stretched pizza and enjoy a second freshly baked
              pizza of equal or lesser value at half price all Wednesday long.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="offer-card">
            <span class="offer-badge">Evenings</span>
            <h3>Sweet Finale Delight</h3>
            <p class="offer-price-tag">Complimentary</p>
            <p class="offer-desc">
              Enjoy a complimentary slice of homemade tiramisu on every table bill of
              &#8377;999 or more when dining in after 7:00 PM.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

